      "message": "Yeah, in general, setting apk_name might cause duplicate rule. But, I think, it does only when apk_name equals to another android_app\u0027s name (or its apk_name). Setting it something wrong (causing duplicate rules) could be detected easily. In that sense, this property seems to be okay. what do you think?\n\nAs you might know, what I want is that override_apex with override_android_app has the same APK path inside the apex. What would be a better way to achieve that?\n\nThanks.",
